	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Capita <persName ref="p6614">Mennonianę</persName> doctrinę adversus Christi domini incarnationem vobis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>hac ęstate transmisi, quae fideliter ad vos perlata esse speramus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Vestrum ad ea <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>aliquod responsum avide expecto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Nedum mihi vacavit responsionem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>adversus <persName ref="p6614">Mennonem</persName> attingere; coactus quippe sum apologiam adversus <placeName>Westphali</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>calumnias et mendacia, quibus nos nostramque ecclesiam denuo gravavit, meditari.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Non te arbitror latere hac ęstate in lucem prodiisse confessionem ecclesiarum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/><placeName ref="l749">Saxonicarum</placeName> de re eucharistica, cui multę et varię insertę sunt literę, inter <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quas unę sub calcem fere inserentur adversus nos <placeName ref="l351">Nordanos</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Consilium <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>itaque fratrum omnium fuit, ut publice nos ab eiusmodi calumniis purgarem.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Tota igitur hac ęstate, dum ocium fuit, in conscribenda apologia laboravi, cui tractationem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>de re eucharistica, in qua adversariorum argumentum ordine pro mea tenuitate <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>dilui, adieci.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Verum iam multi eius dissuadent editionem, ne pacem, quae in superiori <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>comitiolo <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiano</placeName> coepta videtur, nostro scripto perturbare aut impedire <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>videamur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ita hic suspensus hęreo, quid consulto opus sit, ederene <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>an premere responsionem nostram debeamus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ecclesię porro nostrę loco iam <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>sunt bono et tranquillo, quemadmodum et vestram esse speramus <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>beneficio dei, qui vos omnes sospitet ad nominis sui gloriam.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Raptim <placeName ref="l351">Nordę</placeName> 1557. augusti 23.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Tuę humanitati addictissimus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName ref="p8415">Martinus Micronius</persName>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Pręstantissimo pietate et <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>eruditione viro domino <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et patrono in Christo observando, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>apud <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinos</placeName> verbi <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>ministro fidelissimo.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
